{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.62]I figured she was gonna break my heart regardless, regardless\n[00:07.82]I figured she was gonna break my heart regardless\n[00:13.52]So I took her out and dumped her in the garbage\n[00:16.26]The stupid bitch done turned herself into a target\n[00:20.82]Click, clack\n[Chorus]\n[00:22.70]She was gonna break my heart regardless\n[00:25.22]So I took her out and dumped her in the garbage\n[00:27.96]The stupid bitch done turned herself into a target (Yeah)\n[00:31.08]Just for talkin', nonsense, claiming she was leavin'\n[Verse 1]\n[00:35.84]Not gonna happen\n[00:37.54]If I can't have you, no one can\n[00:41.22]'Cause if you leave, I'm not breathin'\n[00:43.76]I'll show you how it feels to not breathe, breathe\n[00:47.26]Inhale, exhale\n[00:50.12]You're the best, well\n[00:53.08]You're the worst, but\n[00:56.02]You're the best hell\n[01:02.10]I ain't ever, ever gonna lose, lose\n[01:10.60]Tell me what I gotta do to prove to you\n[01:13.50]Five seconds from losing my head\n[01:16.44]Now it's time to show you what lunatics do\n[Chorus]\n[01:18.26]She was gonna break my heart regardless\n[01:20.82]So I took her out and dumped her in the garbage\n[01:23.58]The stupid bitch done turned herself into a target (Yeah)\n[01:26.68]Just for talkin', nonsense, claiming she was leavin'\n[01:29.70]I figured she was gonna break my heart regardless\n[01:32.54]So I took her out and dumped her in the garbage\n[01:35.28]The stupid bitch done turned herself into a target (Yeah)\n[01:38.40]Just for talkin', nonsense, claiming she was leavin'\n[Verse 2]\n[01:42.48]Hate it when you tease\n[01:43.94]Where you think you're goin'? When you comin' back to me?\n[01:46.68]You walked in, I'm listening to \"Stan\" on E, yeah, ecstasy\n[01:50.74]Matter of fact, there's a bridge that my car wants to meet\n[01:53.80]Road trip on me, it'll be fun, you'll see\n[01:56.48]But you don't gotta sit in this trunk, you can sit next to me\n[01:59.44]For me and Stan, we alike, but he ai